WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.780
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.410
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.910
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.680
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:40.390
by ridding you...

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.560
...of your other love?

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:48.150
At sunset,

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:50.650
when the children go home,

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:54.610
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:10.000
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:11.880
In a city without light,

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:15.720
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:19.140
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:21.430
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.930
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:35.900
I'm Kurata Sana, age 11.
I'm a sixth grader,

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.660
who's also in Gekidan Komawari,
and active as an entertainer.

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:42.490
Sagami Rei-kun. He's both
my chauffeur and my manager,

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:44.620
as well as my boyfriend and pimp!

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:47.330
Mama. She's an Aoki Laureate novelist
who keeps a chipmunk on her head.

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:54.340
And this is the fiend who is in my class,
6th Grade 3rd Class, Hayama Akito!

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.300
He's like the devil!

00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:00.350
Hayama is the ringleader of the boys in
our class, and they do whatever they want.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:01.760
Our class is a shambles!

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.220
This isn't a school!

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:10.310
Cut it out already, would you?

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:16.280
Eh? His weak spot!?

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:17.610
What? What? What? "What!?"

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:18.610
The truth is...

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:21.620
Eh!? Fear of heights!?

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:25.040
--Um, Sana-chan, don't tell
anyone that I said so.
--Oh, is that right? O-ho-ho!

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:26.950
--Keep it a secret.
--He's got a weakness for high places.

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:29.540
--Okay then, I'm going home now.
--That Akito, he has such
an adorable weakness,

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.920
--All right, see you later...
--doesn't he?

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:38.930
With this, I've got Hayama beaten!

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:45.970
"Operation Eyeball, Toothball!"

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:50.980
Today's the day!

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:53.310
Today's the day, you just watch, Hayama!

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.530
Hey! Hayama!

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.990
Stop that! Stop that, everyone!

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:04.990
S- Sana-chan...?

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:06.410
Are you all right?

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:11.330
Fine... I'm fine...

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.210
Sana-chan, you're creeping me out.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:19.130
SILENCE!!

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:36.270
Hayama! I'm calling you
out to a contest!

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:38.610
A contest?

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:41.950
Against Hayama-san? What kind
of contest is she planning?

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.280
Rock-paper-scissors?

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:48.040
Prattle on.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.080
We're getting nowhere
the way things are.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.620
Let's settle on a winner
and a loser here once and for all!

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.290
Oh my, she's serious.

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:56.960
It looks that way.

00:03:56.960 --> 00:04:00.090
I'll be waiting for you
in the gym after school.

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:02.630
It's no use trying to escape.
Prepare yourself!

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.310
What is she thinking?

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:08.640
I wonder if Sana-chan is all right.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:12.980
Everybody, this is class time.
Take your seats, and lets have class.

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:15.190
"Class is over..."

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:24.990
Nice of you to come!
Nice of you to come! Hayama!

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:27.330
I'm so happy! I'm so happy!
I'm as happy as I've ever bean!

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:31.620
And they taste good over rice, too!
Beans! Beans! Beans!

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:32.960
Okay, Eri-chan! Rumi-chan!

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.080
Right!

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:40.800
You can't escape now, Hayama Akito-kun!

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.930
Okay, onto the contest! Look over there!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:54.310
What's with that anxious
look on your face--?

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.650
Why are you so calm?

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:57.650
You wouldn't get anxious over
something that wasn't there, would you?

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:59.980
Aya-chan! Yoo-hoo, Aya-chan!

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.980
What, Sana-chan?

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:06.990
Please! It isn't ready!
It isn't ready! It isn't ready!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.780
--If you would, if you would,
--Whoops. Was that me?

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.660
Like the way we planned!
Like the way we planned!

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.660
Sana-chan, I'm supposed
to pull on this, right?

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:15.330
Right! Right! Right! Right! Right!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.670
What's this?

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:26.430
Well? Are you surprised?
My Mama bought it mail order.

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:30.390
It's an "Easy for Everyone Bungee
Jump Set!" It cost 30,000 yen.

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:34.930
It's perfectly safe,

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:37.270
as you can be assuredly see by the
included "Person's weight mannequin."

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.730
You're serious about doing this?

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:41.860
Also, there will be
this high-sensitivity mike,

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:44.860
which can pick up even the quietest voice.
We'll use this to compare our voices.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:48.280
When you jump, whoever yells the
loudest loses. How about that?

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:49.620
I get it.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:51.530
This could be pretty fun.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:57.830
Come on, Hayama-chan!
How about giving it a shot?

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:02.960
Ah! Hey, now!

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:04.380
Are you running away, Hayama?

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.630
It's not very cool to turn
your butt toward your enemy!

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:11.300
Don't run away, Hayama-kun!
Come here, come here, "lovely boy!"

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:15.310
This is stupid. You think I
would do something like this?

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:18.640
Oh, dear! You nervous?
Or are you a "baby?"

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.440
Don't tell me you're afraid of heights.

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.650
It wouldn't be something
like that, right?

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:25.650
You dumb-ass! There's no way
Hayama-san is scared!

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:27.990
Oh, is that right?
Nice if that were true.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.660
Hayama-san, are you going
to let her say that?

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:31.620
Do it, please!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:32.620
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.290
Show her how strong you are!

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.620
Right, right.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:39.290
Say, you don't suppose Hayama-kun
is afraid of heights, do you?

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:40.960
You're kidding!
With that look on his face?

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:44.920
You're right, madam.
That would be foolish.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:49.300
U- um, Sana-chan...?
Akito-kun won't exactly be...

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:52.720
What are you telling me!?
I know, starting a fight

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:55.930
just to hit someone in his weak spot
may be fighting a little bit dirty,

00:06:55.930 --> 00:07:00.940
but when you consider everything he's
done up to now, it's nothing at all!

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:03.770
Come on, Hayama! What will it be?

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:07.940
If I win, then from now on,
you'll have to do exactly as I say.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:21.670
And if I win, you're not allowed to
meddle in anything I do, all right?

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:23.290
Fine!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.960
Aya-chan, mike!

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.630
Excuse me...

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:27.840
I beg your pardon...

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:35.680
Yahoo! I did it! I did it!
This contest is as good as won!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:39.770
After all, I love being in high places!

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:46.570
"Bungee Confrontation with Hayama"

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.610
Make sure you good boys
and girls don't go trying this.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:46.570
They wouldn't, ordinarily.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.280
Hayama-san, good luck!

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.950
Show them what kind of man
you are, Hayama-san!

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:55.950
Is the setup okay, Hisae-chan?

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:56.620
Mm-hm!

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:58.950
Hayama!

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:02.620
We'll see your face
in tears very soon now.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:05.630
"Are you going to cry, Hayama!?"

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:09.630
Hayama-san!

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:24.270
He's nervous! He's nervous!

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:27.980
Hey, what are you waiting for!?
Hurry up and jump, "Peggy" Hayama!

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:30.320
What? "Peggy"? Sana-chan,
what's a "Peggy"?

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:35.410
Peggy Hayama is the name of a singer.
Ask a grown-up nearby for more details.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.710
Hayama-san!

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:55.930
He said "Ooh," right?
He just said "Ooh," right?

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:57.930
I've got him!

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:59.260
"I've got him!"

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:02.930
Now, if you don't say anything,
Sana-chan, you win, right?

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:06.770
All right, all right! Okay! Okay!
Just leave it to me now! I've already won!

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:13.940
Yoo-hoo! I'm not scared at all!

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.950
--Be careful, my darling.
--I love high places!

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:20.950
--What are you talking about?
--Kurata stands on high towers!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.000
Here I go!

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.960
Ah, damn! She's adopting a strange pose!

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.670
She's just showing off.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.950
Sana-chan...

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:06.960
What happened to all that confidence
you had before you jumped?

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:17.340
I'm... good when it
comes to high places...

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:22.720
...but as far as falling
from anyplace high...

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:25.930
...I'd never done it.

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:31.020
That was the flaw in my strategy.

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:42.830
I'm not sure what happened,
but that means I won, right?

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:48.580
I lost...

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.170
Okay, okay, thank you, thank you.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:56.260
That's pathetic,
over something like a bungee jump.

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:59.130
I'm so mad at myself!

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:05.390
When you were a baby, we played Up-ups
as high as three meters,

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.270
and you shrieked with delight.

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:08.930
Three meters...!?

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:12.270
--Up-up!
--Ah, Sensei!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.940
That must be how I got so scared!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:18.940
I'm sure that's the reason
why I was scared of falling!

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.610
I hate this!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.950
Ah! Sana-chan, that's tomorrow's script!

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:27.620
Um, I'm your editor, Onda.
I've been waiting since last week.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:30.620
Sensei, is your manuscript ready?

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.210
Not in the least!

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:35.960
"Sana-chan Sings"

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:41.970
♪ Miserable defeat has me
deep in the blues! ♪

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:44.300
♪ The weather may have cleared,
but my heart is still dark ♪

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.310
♪ Rain is falling, splish-splash,
deep in the blues! ♪

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:48.310
♪ I'm just an unlucky Twist Girl. ♪

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:50.310
♪ I lost! I lost! I lost! Sana lost! ♪
--Manuscript! Manuscript!
Sensei, manuscript!

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.650
♪ Tomorrow, tomorrow, tomorrow, tomorrow, ♪

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.310
♪ what's going to happen at school? ♪

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:56.110
"It's the worst of schools"

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:03.780
Stop! Anything but that!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.170
Stop!

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:23.180
--No! Anything but that!
--Oh, but they're so cute!

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:24.510
Hold on...!

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:25.720
Don't meddle.

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.680
--I can't take any more!
--We did it!

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.730
I'm such an idiot.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:38.940
Sana-chan, if you keep
working yourself up like this,

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:39.780
you're going to become a worm.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:43.490
Would you stop with your
disgusting consolations!?

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:44.780
That's odd. Did I get it wrong?

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:44.820
"'How to Console Women'
by Obana Miho"

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:46.450
What kind of book are you reading!?

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.780
Sana-chan, are you going
to give up like this?

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:49.790
We couldn't take that!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:52.160
I'm not giving up! Not until
I make Hayama say "Uncle!"

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.500
Uncle.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.500
Uncle. Uncle.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:57.500
Uncle. Uncle. Uncle.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.130
Uncle. Uncle.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:03.510
Sana-chan, if you keep gnashing around
like this, you're going to become a gnat.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:04.840
Shut up!

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:05.800
You guys!

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:08.800
Cut it out already, you guys!
Stop this! Stop it!

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:09.810
Here you go.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:11.850
Pizza's here!

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:13.680
This book is filled
with nothing but lies.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:17.860
You guys...!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.860
How's your pizza?

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:33.040
Tanaka-sensei! It's you acting
like this that's the problem here!

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.120
Why don't you stand up to those guys!?

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:38.750
You're the teacher! You should
look sharp, like a teacher! Sharp!

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.460
Can't you look sharper!? Sharp--?

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.460
You're kidding!

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:45.800
Hey, stop that. Don't cry like that.
Don't droop your eyes.

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:48.390
Don't wipe away your tears
with your hands like that.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.140
Stop sticking your
bottom lip out like that.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:53.470
I can't stand the life of a teacher!

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.810
Sensei!

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:56.810
What is this!?

00:13:56.810 --> 00:14:00.150
What? What? What? What? What? Sensei!

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:02.860
"Tanaka-sensei talks confidentially"

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:05.820
Kurata...

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:09.990
What exactly is the matter here?
You look positively gloomy, Sensei.

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:14.700
T- the truth is...

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:18.170
No, this isn't the sort of thing
you can talk to a child about.

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:20.420
Why don't you tell me
everything, Sensei?

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.170
I think you will feel
better once you do.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:25.840
Yeah? You're right.
You think so? Yeah, you're right.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:28.840
Well, you see...
that is to say... uh...

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:33.810
The truth is, me and... uh...
your teacher... Mitsuya-sensei...

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:36.430
are, um... how shall I say...?

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:39.190
You're making it, right? Everyone knows.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.770
R- really...?

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:47.780
So, we often take our breaks
together here in the nurse's office.

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.450
And Hayama knew about it.

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:51.450
Hayama?

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:54.120
He took a picture of us that one time!

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.450
Picture?

00:14:56.790 --> 00:15:01.790
At the time, we just...
got caught up in the mood, you see...

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.800
and as it happens...

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.590
You were making out?

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:23.480
Well, yeah.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:24.480
You're kidding!

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:30.320
How lewd!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:34.120
There's no need to shout it so loudly.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:36.290
That's the vocalization I
learned in Gekidan Komawari.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:37.790
Although I am starting
to feel a little dizzy.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:39.000
"Well, in any case..."

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:43.460
For teachers to be making out with each
other at school comes as a great shock.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.290
I'll dance the make-out mambo!

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:48.460
--Make-out! Make-out! Mambo! Make-out!
--You don't have to dance,
just listen to me.

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:53.390
Anyhow, because of that,
Hayama is taking advantage of us.

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:57.470
We can't report any of the trouble
he's making to those above us.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.810
What!?

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.480
Sensei, you should have known better,

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:02.270
but I can't let Hayama
get away with this!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:06.400
You dirty coward!!

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:10.150
Right, okay! Sana-chan, that was great!

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:11.820
Ah, thanks.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.320
What's up, Sana-chan?
That was amazingly compelling!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:16.490
You wouldn't think
this was a variety drama.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:20.500
I really felt like I was
a doity cowuhd there.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:23.170
I just thought about that idiot,
and I couldn't help but get fired up.

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:25.500
"That idiot"? Which idiot is that?

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.790
How am I going to get the pictures of
the teachers making out with each other

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:28.840
away from him?

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:31.470
M- making out? How do you mean?
Sounds interesting.

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:32.840
Tell me awl about it. Okay?

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:36.430
If you get the make-out pictures back,
the situation will improve?

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:37.510
S- shua it will!

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:39.770
But now, befo-ah you do, tell me
awl about these make-out pitch-uhs.

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:44.100
Hm, but that's not possible. It's not
like he's going to agree to listen to me.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:47.520
Is that right? Well, why don'tcha tell
me mo-ah about these make-out pitch-uhs,

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.110
and maybe I can be of help.

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:50.780
It's okay, there is another way.

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:52.440
Really? Awl right!
Befo-ah you tell us the way,

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.780
let's hea-uh about these
make-out pitch-uhs.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:56.450
"An eye for an eye,
and a tooth for a tooth."

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:57.450
What's that?

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:01.120
Yeah, he'll explain what he means,
but about those make-out--

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:02.120
In short,

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:05.790
Sana-chan, you somehow or other take
an embarrassing picture of Hayama-kun.

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.380
And then, you threaten him
that if he doesn't do as you say,

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:09.800
you're going to go
public with that picture.

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:13.090
--Oh, I get it! I can do that!
--So, yeah, about these
make-out pitch-uhs...

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.800
Rei-kun, you're so smart!

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:20.470
It may be fighting a little dirty,
but after all, Hayama-kun is doing it.

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:23.810
Rei-kun, I love that
vicious streak of yours!

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:25.810
I know! I'll get Tsuyoshi-kun to help me!

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:27.480
Tsuyoshi-kun? You mean
the boy with the glasses?

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.480
Just you watch, Hayama!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:33.900
An eye for an eyeball,
and a tooth for a toothball!

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:38.070
What's a toothball?

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:40.700
This week's Sana-chan.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:41.620
"Hayama"

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:47.790
Is that Hayama's house?

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:50.750
Sherlock Holmes. I borrowed it
from Gekidan Komawari for free.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:51.750
This is my smoking pipe.

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:54.130
Sana-chan, you're the type
that gets taken in by form, huh?

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:56.090
And this is a Polaroid camera.

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:59.390
I'm going to take an
embarrassing picture of him with this!

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:03.180
Say, Sana-chan, are you
sure you won't give this up?

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:06.770
"No program!"

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:08.480
You mean "problem," right?

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:11.150
Tsuyoshi-kun, don't worry,
I won't let him lay a hand on you.

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:14.440
Now then, how shall we
lure him out, Washington-kun?

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:15.820
Watson, isn't it?

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:20.120
It's all your fault! Just looking
at your face makes me sick!

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.160
What was that just now?

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:24.830
I think that's his older sister's voice.

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.830
Get out of this house right now!

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:29.790
Are you the one who built this house,
you hysterical girl!?

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:34.800
What!? I wish you had never been born!
If only you weren't around!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.090
A family quarrel?

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:40.640
You... devil! You're the devil!

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:45.100
Don't come back! Don't ever
come back again, devil!

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:54.940
"Devil"? Is that really his sister?
I can't believe it. I mean, "devil"...

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.250
Hayama...

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:13.130
Ah, that's his father.

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.460
Eh? Hayama's?

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:15.460
Mm-hmm.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:23.390
What? What? Why? Hey, how come?
Are you sure that's Hayama's dad?

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:28.140
How come? How come he didn't
ask him anything? How come?

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:29.640
How come?

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:34.060
Say, what are we going to do?
He's leaving.

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:35.440
Sana-chan...

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:40.530
Somehow... I'm surprised...

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:45.030
Even he makes that face...

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:50.290
Sana-chan, listen, should we give up?
Let's give up.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.750
Come on! We're following him!

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.080
We're doing it after all, huh?

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:59.010
"After all, it's not like we can overlook
everything else he's done up to now"

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.260
He went into the park.

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:07.100
Now you've flown into the fire,
stupid Hayama.

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:09.140
Come on, Tsuyoshi-kun,
now's our chance.

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:11.100
"Operation: Eye for an Eyeball,
Tooth for a Toothball!"

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:13.100
When did the operation get that name?

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.770
No dawdling around! You'll never
become a great detective like that!

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:17.480
I don't want to become one.

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:20.110
Come on, hurry up and get out there!

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:22.400
Hold on, don't push me, Sana-chan.

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:27.950
Okay, this time I'm really
going to nail that Hayama!

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:32.830
H- huh? Hey, if it isn't Akito-kun.
Fancy you being here.

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.630
Oh, what happened to your hand there?

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:41.090
Nothing.

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:42.420
Now, Tsuyoshi! Go!

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:44.130
Forgive me, Akito-kun!

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:53.100
Why, you... Tsuyoshi...

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:54.980
What did you do that for
all of a sudden!?

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:59.110
Hayama Akito! You're finished now!

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:02.150
I got a silly picture
of you there in the huff!

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:07.450
Oh, here it comes!
Whoo, what's this!? Stupidity uncovered!

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:09.120
Want to see?

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:12.160
So, maybe I'll make a
bunch of copies of this

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.460
and paste them up all over school!

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:15.120
Y- you...

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:18.380
Oh, what? You don't have any
right being upset over this!

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:20.130
All I did was duplicate
what you're doing.

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:24.170
Well? You're angry, right?
Frustrated, right? You should be sorry!

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:27.930
Whoa! If you get angry at Tsuyoshi-kun,

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:30.470
I'll pass these bare-naked
pictures around, too!

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:34.980
Come and take it away from me,
if you can!

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:36.770
It's the walkie-talkie
that shakes, Burutcha!

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:41.480
S- Sana-chan! I'm off!

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:45.820
Come on, come on! Can you keep up with
this step I learned in Gekidan Komawari?

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:48.160
What are you, a tumbling act?

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:50.160
Way to go, Rei-kun! Nice timing!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:53.160
If you do anything to Sana-chan,
I'll pass this photo out!

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:03.510
Now, then...

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:05.170
Hayama Akito-kun...

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:13.220
How about you hand over
that picture of the teachers?

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:23.230
Hayama-kun...

00:22:38.790 --> 00:22:40.290
"Back against the wall."

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:45.800
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:47.050 --> 00:22:50.550
In dire straits,

00:22:51.340 --> 00:22:54.100
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:57.980
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:03.060
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:09.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:11.320
...panic!!

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:17.200
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:19.870
he's there.

00:23:20.790 --> 00:23:23.130
And our usual classroom...

00:23:23.340 --> 00:23:25.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:28.210
...for two.

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:31.680
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:36.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:37.350 --> 00:23:40.060
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:40.230 --> 00:23:44.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:50.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:52.990
he's there,

00:23:53.950 --> 00:23:56.160
And our usual classroom...

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:58.790
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:58.910 --> 00:24:01.290
...for two.

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:08.960
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.010 --> 00:24:13.930
The game is over! Sana-chan wins!
Hayama finally apologizes!

00:24:13.930 --> 00:24:15.470
Or so we thought,
but what's this, what's this?

00:24:15.470 --> 00:24:17.600
Now, he's run afoul of the boys, too!

00:24:17.600 --> 00:24:19.390
A challenge for the
position of boss monkey?

00:24:19.390 --> 00:24:21.600
Yuck! That's some yucky, yucky business!

00:24:21.600 --> 00:24:24.270
How come you're so gloomy? Huh?

00:24:24.270 --> 00:24:28.360
Next time on Child's Toy, Episode 4
of the Cold Wind of the Heart Saga:

00:24:28.320 --> 00:24:34.410
"Lone Wolf, Awooo!"

00:24:28.360 --> 00:24:30.610
"Lone Wolf, Awooo!"

00:24:30.610 --> 00:24:32.900
I'm worried about Tsuyoshi-kun.
